{"4318300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dino VR Experience", "steam_appid": 4318300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino VR Museum is an immersive VR experience that transports you into an interactive museum dedicated to dinosaurs. Explore 4 themed areas with animated dinosaurs, discover scientific information, and experience the atmosphere of a real paleontological museum.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During Early Access we will add new areas, dinosaurs, an expanded museum/HUB, and a playground area where you can simulate the excavation and discovery of fossils.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is designed for VR players who enjoy exploration, education, and narrative content related to paleontology.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino VR Museum is an immersive VR experience that transports you into an interactive museum dedicated to dinosaurs. Explore 4 themed areas with animated dinosaurs, discover scientific information, and experience the atmosphere of a real paleontological museum.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During Early Access we will add new areas, dinosaurs, an expanded museum/HUB, and a playground area where you can simulate the excavation and discovery of fossils.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is designed for VR players who enjoy exploration, education, and narrative content related to paleontology.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Dino VR Experience is an explorable virtual museum. All areas are consistent with the biomes of the respective dinosaurs, and these biomes are partially explorable. The museum also contains audio and text information to fully immerse the user.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akam